helper_functions.py is an unchanged reference fixture for AST inspection only.
No Keras/TensorFlow/nnU-Net framework is imported by the training runtime.

Team adaptation in models/rpdnet/fuse_ndc.py and RepDWNet.py:
- Implemented PyTorch/NCHW H units using two Conv/ReLU/Dropout operations.
- Ported truncated He distribution based on Keras2.2.4 reference mathematics.
- Kept P2 bilinear x2+pad and RepDW decoder with fixed mid/output channels.
- Omitted separate kernel-L2 objective; retained P2 coupled Adam WD policy.
- Kept one3-class raw-logit head; no DS, transpose upsampling or node pruning.
These adaptations do not claim invention of UNet++ or nested dense connectivity.

